{
  "SM_004080_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Not bad. Better than your crying.\r\nPunishment, is it? With pleasure![FONT:N ]\r\n\r\nBoth Cereza and Cheshire were on fire.",
  "BK_4000_0040_NAR": "How could this be?\r\nBefore Cereza stood her mother.",
  "SM_004060_0010_NAR": "But the wolf just stared at her,\r\nshowing no signs of moving.\r\n\r\nLet's go together!\r\nThe wolf's determined eyes\r\nseemed to be saying to her.",
  "BK_4060_0040_POO": "“Long live the faerie kingdom!”\r\n",
  "IN_40000_0020_NAR": "Desperate to reach her mother,\r\nshe walked faster and faster.",
  "LV_004020_0000_NAR": "Just visible through the twilight haze\r\nstood a large structure that\r\npierced the sky like a castle spire.",
  "CE_004800_0000_CER": "This guy's full of surprises.\r\n...Umm, we'd better run!",
  "SM_004030_0050_CER": "“Hmph, not my problem!”",
  "IN_40000_0010_NAR": "Cereza was drawn forward\r\ntowards the apparition.",
  "LV_004085_0015_NAR": "Cheshire said, in a slightly embarrassed voice.",
  "CE_004000_0000_CER": "Mummy? It can't be...",
  "SM_004050_0060_NAR": "Forgetting the peril of her situation,\r\nCereza rushed to follow the\r\nfaeries into their stronghold.",
  "BK_4080_0180_CER": "“Besides, if it wasn't for me,\r\nyou wouldn't be in this mess\r\nin the first place.",
  "BK_4080_0090_NAR": "There was only one way\r\nshe could think to do it.",
  "BK_4080_0010_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_004020_0070_CER": "“G-good try Avalon, but\r\nit'll take more to scare this witch.”",
  "LV_004025_0000_CER": "There could be faeries anywhere.\r\nI've got to keep quiet.",
  "SM_004010_0110_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I save you, and this is the thanks I get?\r\nMaybe if you weren't so helpless,\r\nI wouldn't need to fight all your battles![FONT:N ]\r\n\r\nCheshire was not about to back down.\r\n",
  "LV_004080_0000_CER": "Restoration magic...\r\nI've never been able to pull that off before.",
  "SM_004070_0030_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]It is simple:\r\nwe just need the girl...[FONT:N ]",
  "BK_4020_0090_POO": "“The very trees of Avalon\r\nbow before us to pay obeisance.”\r\n",
  "BK_4020_0020_NAR": "It was the regal faerie from earlier.\r\n",
  "CE_004010_0010_CER": "If it's broke, fix it!",
  "BK_4020_0100_POO": "“We are Púca the wise, \r\nPúca the magnanimous.”\r\n",
  "SM_004070_0120_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "LV_004015_0000_CER": "I can get through this forest \r\nfine by myself.\r\nI'm not s-scared!",
  "SM_004040_0000_NAR": "Cereza once again spotted Cheshire.\r\n\r\nIncapacitated by his wounds,\r\nhe was surrounded by faeries.",
  "SM_004140_0040_NAR": "Realising what had happened,\r\nCereza hurriedly began wiping her face clean.\r\n\r\nThe spectacle was too much for Cheshire.\r\nHe rolled with laughter.\r\n",
  "BK_4020_0050_NAR": "The regal faerie continued \r\nhis haughty monologue.\r\nStill, his thick accent\r\nwas nigh unintelligible.\r\n",
  "BK_4020_0170_POO": "“We shall call down\r\na blast from heaven\r\nand make them rue their folly!”",
  "SM_004070_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Stay out of our way and we will\r\nensure your return to the demon realm![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_4020_0140_CER": "“Wha...okay...so it was you who did\r\nall that awful stuff to Cheshire!\r\nI see a royal behind \r\nin need of a good spanking!”\r\n",
  "SM_004035_0020_NAR": "Speaking of Cheshire...\r\nCereza couldn't help remembering him.",
  "SM_004070_0160_CER": "“Thanks!”",
  "BK_4070_0010_CER": "”I wish I'd never summoned you!”",
  "LV_004060_0010_CER": "I don't understand what they're saying \r\nbut if I know these faeries it must \r\nbe something absolutely nefarious.",
  "LV_004925_0000_CER": "“I'm soaked.\r\nI told you to go slow!”",
  "SM_004020_0000_CER": "“Who needs Cheshire anyway.\r\nI can take care of myself!”",
  "SM_004035_0010_NAR": "The optimism she had right after splitting\r\nup with Cheshire was long gone.",
  "SM_004070_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]What will it be?\r\nThis is your last chance, demon![FONT:N ]",
  "SM_004110_0110_NAR": "Cereza and Cheshire exchanged a glance.\r\nGetting the power from Lukaon\r\nwould mean the end to their journey.\r\nIt would mean saying farewell.",
  "SM_004010_0150_NAR": "Then came the straw that\r\nbroke the demon's back.",
  "BK_4060_0000_POO": "“O woe are we!\r\nOur heavenly minion vanquished...\r\nThe flames of defeat draw near.”",
  "LV_004005_0010_CER": "I swear I heard something...",
  "BK_4080_0060_CER": "“Hold still. If you move around like\r\nthat you'll just make things worse.”",
  "BK_4000_0000_NAR": "Cereza and Cheshire were not alone.\r\nGlowing eyes watched from the shadows.",
  "BK_4080_0100_MOR": "“Remember Cereza...",
  "SM_004100_0020_CER": "“You're going to take us to Lukaon?\r\nWe must be getting close...\r\nCome on Cheshire, hurry!”",
  "SM_004050_0090_CER": "“You!”",
  "SM_004090_0030_LUC": "“Soon, we will meet at last.\r\nCereza, I count down the hours...”",
  "SM_004050_0010_NAR": "The faeries had captured Cheshire.\r\nWithin their ranks was one \r\nregal-looking faerie who stood out\r\nfrom all the others.",
  "CE_004030_0000_CER": "Back to Paradiso with you.",
  "SM_004050_0130_CER": "“Be careful!”",
  "SM_004090_0000_LUC": "“Is there no challenge you\r\ncannot overcome?\r\nCereza, you amaze me.”",
  "SM_004050_0020_NAR": "He appeared to be talking to \r\nCheshire, but it was too far to hear\r\nwhat he was saying.",
  "BK_4080_0140_NAR": "These were the precious locks Cereza\r\nwas growing out to resemble her mother.",
  "SM_004080_0025_NAR": "It was splendid teamwork.",
  "LV_004070_0000_CER": "This reminds me of climbing \r\nthe clocktower with Jeanne...",
  "SM_004050_0125_CER": "“This should allow me to get in\r\nwithout being discovered by those\r\npesky faeries. Thank you!”\r\n",
  "LV_004055_0000_CER": "This tower just keeps going...\r\nCheshire...where are they taking you?",
  "LV_004040_0010_NAR": "Along its walls\r\ncracks in the metal formed hideous gaping mouths.",
  "LV_004090_0000_NAR": "The sphere burned with a bright red light.\r\nThe two had arrived at the final Elemental Core.",
  "SM_004060_0025_CER": "“...Don't tell Cheshire I said that.”",
  "SM_004050_0070_CER": "“No good...\r\nThere must be another way in.”",
  "SM_004030_0040_NAR": "Cereza heard a familiar voice.\r\nIt was Cheshire.\r\n\r\nInjured, he was fleeing from\r\na group of faeries.",
  "LV_004020_0010_CER": "Cereza, you can do this \r\non your own...You don't need \r\nanyone's help...",
  "CE_004815_0000_CER": "Now!",
  "SM_004060_0000_CER": "“Listen, this fortress\r\nis crawling with faeries.\r\nI think you should sit this one out.”",
  "LV_004085_0020_CER": "Yeah, I think it suits you perfectly.",
  "BK_4000_0050_CER": "“Mummy? Is it really you?”",
  "BK_4080_0030_NAR": "The faeries had not been kind \r\nto their captive. Cheshire could \r\nhide his pain no longer. ",
  "BK_4070_0040_NAR": "Cereza's final words echoed off the trees. \r\nThen all was still.",
  "Pooka_vo_disappear_01": "That was but luck, and nothing other!\r\nLuck, you hear?! Listen!",
  "SM_004070_0130_NAR": "Cereza had jumped out without\r\nan action plan of any sort.",
  "BK_4020_0030_CER": "“Hey,\r\nthat faerie is speaking our language!\r\n...I think.”",
  "LV_004900_0000_CER": "Nothing to worry about...\r\nA leaf this big will hold us up no problem...\r\nRight?",
  "SM_004140_0020_CER": "“...Hmm?\r\nWhat are you on about?”",
  "BK_4000_0020_ROS": "“Cer...Cereza...”",
  "SM_004010_0130_CER": "“And just so we're clear,\r\nyou say I'm weak, but you can't survive\r\nwithout me either, remember!?”",
  "BK_4080_0240_NAR": "Cereza gave Cheshire a tight embrace.\r\n\r\nSomehow, she felt that Cheshire \r\nwas doing the same.",
  "SM_004110_0010_MOR": "“Cereza, what have you done \r\nwith your hair?!”\r\n",
  "SM_004140_0010_CER": "“Ugh...\r\nWhat was with that guy...”",
  "SM_004010_0020_NAR": "Cheshire's strike had\r\nshattered the illusion,\r\nbut it had taken a \r\nfrightful toll on Cereza.",
  "SM_004070_0100_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Like I can trust a faerie!\r\nI'll devour every last one of you![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_8120_0000_CER": "“And that's number four.\r\nWe destroyed all the Elemental Cores!”",
  "SM_004070_0090_NAR": "Then she heard the familiar\r\ndeep growl...",
  "SM_004020_0060_NAR": "...A small bunny rabbit\r\nemerged from the bushes.\r\nCereza breathed a sigh of relief. ",
  "SM_004110_0100_CER": "“Oh, I'll defeat them all right.\r\nAnd after that I'll meet Lukaon,\r\nget that power, and send you back...”\r\n",
  "LV_004010_0003_CER": "Mummy!",
  "BK_4020_0040_POO": "“Fie, her insolence knows no bounds!\r\nRepent! For a king's anger once \r\nstoked is not easily quenched.”",
  "LV_004930_0000_CER": "Ah!\r\nIf I'm not careful I'll be burnt to a crisp!",
  "BK_4020_0070_CER": "“This is hopeless, it must be\r\nsome kind of faerie dialect.\r\nSo, what, are you saying you're\r\nthe faerie king or something?”",
  "LV_004060_0000_NAR": "Within, the faeries seemed to be \r\narguing about something loudly.",
  "BK_4070_0000_NAR": "Cheshire broke the silence with a threatening growl.",
  "BK_4020_0150_NAR": "Cheshire looked happy to oblige.\r\n",
  "SM_004010_0060_NAR": "...But the tears would not stop.\r\n",
  "SM_004140_0050_CER": "“Now it's personal.\r\nThat creepy faerie best hope \r\nwe never cross paths again.\r\n\r\nOkay chucklepuss, joke's over.\r\n\r\nAll right, let's get a move on!”",
  "SM_004040_0010_CER": "“What has he gotten himself into now...\r\n...Nope, not going to worry about it!”",
  "SM_004110_0050_MOR": "“Under normal circumstances\r\nnow would come a stern lecture,\r\nbut that will have to wait for your\r\nsafe return.”",
  "LV_004935_0000_NAR": "Cereza was on her own this time.\r\nHow was she going to get out of this pickle? ",
  "LV_004065_0000_CER": "Look at all those faeries!\r\nHow am I going to make it out of here?",
  "SM_004050_0030_CER": "“What does that faerie want with Cheshire?”",
  "SM_004050_0120_NAR": "The hole was just big enough for\r\nan apprentice witch to fit through.",
  "SM_004050_0000_CER": "“Who is he talking to...?”",
  "LV_004010_0010_CER": "Mummy, wait! Mummy, please!!",
  "SM_004050_0110_NAR": "It called out to her before\r\nrunning away.",
  "SM_004110_0090_MOR": "“The faeries are a formidable foe.\r\nBut use all I taught you and defeat them.\r\n\r\n\r\nMay the moon light your path...\r\nStay safe, Cereza.",
  "SM_004020_0075_CER": "“Now then, where did that wolf get to!”",
  "Pooka_vo_disappear_07": "You are but an infantile witch, \r\nhow dare you make Púca suffer so?!",
  "LV_004030_0000_NAR": "Cereza stood against the faeries alone.\r\nJust how did she plan on beating them?",
  "BK_4020_0120_POO": "“Púca,\r\nthe one true king of Avalon Forest!”",
  "CE_004810_0000_CER": "They just keep coming!\r\nWe have to take down that faerie!",
  "LV_004025_0010_CER": "If those faeries spot me I'll be in trouble.\r\nBetter move softly.",
  "BK_4020_0000_NAR": "Something made them stop.\r\nA strange presence...\r\nThey were not alone.",
  "SM_004070_0010_NAR": "They had finally found Cheshire.\r\nHe was covered in wounds\r\nfrom head to toe.",
  "CE_004010_0000_CER": "That torture device...\r\nIf I use my magic to fix it...",
  "BK_4020_0110_POO": "“...Pause for dramatic effect.”",
  "SM_004070_0020_NAR": "Hiding in the shadows, Cereza was \r\nsurprised to hear one of the faeries \r\nspeaking words she understood.",
  "BK_4020_0080_POO": "“Insolence! \r\nBefore us all bend the knee. \r\nThose with four legs bend two.”",
  "BK_4090_0010_CER": "“I'm coming Mummy,\r\ndon't leave me again!”",
  "LV_004050_0000_CER": "Oh, Cheshire, just what have you \r\ngotten yourself into this time...",
  "SM_004010_0100_NAR": "Unable to take Cheshire's abuse\r\nany longer, Cereza leapt to her feet.\r\n\r\nBehind her tears, \r\nCereza's eyes burned with fury.",
  "LV_004080_0010_CER": "I wonder if it might work \r\non something else...?",
  "SM_004010_0010_CER": "“Mummy!”",
  "LV_004035_0000_CER": "I'm so close...\r\nI can't give up now!",
  "BK_4060_0045_POO": "“...longlivepúca.”",
  "LV_004040_0020_CER": "What...is that?\r\nI've seen plenty of rifts in the forest,\r\nbut that thing is on a whole new level.",
  "SM_004050_0040_NAR": "The faeries carried him\r\ninto some kind of fortress.",
  "BK_4080_0080_NAR": "Cereza needed to suture the wound \r\nas soon as possible.",
  "LV_004085_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]A cut like this is nothing.\r\nBut...this ribbon isn't so bad.[FONT:N ]",
  "LV_004905_0000_CER": "Cheshire, you can swim?!\r\nI-I'll pass. I don't want to get my hair wet.",
  "BK_4080_0190_CER": "I promised to send you back.\r\nUmbra Witch's honour.”",
  "SM_004060_0030_NAR": "And so,\r\nCereza and the white wolf infiltrated\r\ndeep into the enemy stronghold.\r\n",
  "BK_4080_0160_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Don't blame me if that teacher of yours has a fit,[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire said quietly.",
  "SM_004080_0010_NAR": "The sudden appearance of two intruders\r\nhad the faerie fortress in a frenzy.",
  "SM_004090_0020_LUC": "“Yes, your control of that demon is\r\na testament to your skill as a witch.”",
  "LV_004005_0000_CER": "Hm? Cheshire, you say something?",
  "BK_4080_0110_MOR": "As blood flows through veins,\r\nmagic flows through a witch's hair.",
  "CE_004030_0020_CER": "Farewell.",
  "BK_4000_0010_NAR": "Whispering an enchantment,\r\nthe faeries made their move.",
  "SM_004030_0030_CER": "“No, I'm better off without that beast!\r\nI can make it through this forest myself!”",
  "BK_4060_0010_POO": "“But even should the pyre consume our very self,\r\nthese interlopers shall go no further!”",
  "BK_4060_0020_CER": "“What's he saying now...\r\nI have a bad feeling about this.”",
  "LV_004070_0010_CER": "She acted so tough...\r\nBut I knew she was scared.",
  "SM_004080_0020_NAR": "Cereza seized the opportunity \r\nand freed Cheshire from his shackles.",
  "BK_4080_0150_NAR": "As expected, they worked their magic.\r\nCheshire's wound closed in an instant.",
  "SM_004100_0000_CER": "“That howl...\r\nYou made it out of the fortress!”",
  "BK_4080_0120_MOR": "Care for it as you would your \r\nmost precious tool, and defend it \r\nas you would your very heart.”",
  "BK_4080_0040_CER": "“That cut!”",
  "CE_004030_0010_CER": "Say your prayers!",
  "SM_004070_0050_NAR": "They were speaking Enochian,\r\nthe language of angels and demons.\r\nIt sounded like the regal faerie was\r\ntrying to strike a deal with Cheshire.",
  "SM_004020_0020_CER": "“Cheshire?”",
  "SM_004070_0140_CER": "“Out of the way!”",
  "BK_4070_0030_CER": "“Good! That's it, we're through!”",
  "BK_4020_0160_POO": "“Human and demon dare\r\nchallenge Púca, whose name strikes\r\nfear across all three realms?”",
  "SM_004110_0020_CER": "“S-sorry...I just,\r\nI needed it for something.”",
  "SM_004010_0170_NAR": "Cheshire's eyes narrowed.\r\nFor a second, he was quiet.",
  "BK_4080_0200_CER": "“W-what I'm trying to say is...”",
  "LV_004015_0010_CER": "Where did that wolf go...\r\nMust be this way.",
  "LV_004950_0000_CER": "Mummy...Please, don't go!",
  "SM_004040_0020_NAR": "But before she knew what she was doing,\r\nCereza had set off in Cheshire's direction.\r\n",
  "SM_004140_0060_NAR": "Cereza frowned and stormed off.\r\n\r\nTrying unsuccessfully to control his laughter,\r\nCheshire followed after.\r\n\r\nBut each glance at Cereza sent him back \r\ninto fits of seam-bursting chortles.",
  "SM_004010_0140_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Look at you! You wouldn't last five\r\nminutes in this forest without me![FONT:N ]\r\n\r\nTheir fight was quickly reaching \r\nits boiling point.",
  "CE_004020_0000_CER": "Now, Cheshire!",
  "BK_4080_0230_CER": "“Yes, your majesty.”",
  "SM_004035_0000_NAR": "Somehow Cereza had made it through.\r\nSolo adventuring was turning out\r\nmuch more difficult than she had anticipated.",
  "SM_004020_0010_CER": "“And don't come crying to me when\r\nyour magic runs out!”",
  "SM_004070_0060_NAR": "Cereza felt her heart beating in her chest.",
  "SM_004140_0030_CER": "“What the!? \r\nOh, give me a break!!”",
  "SM_004010_0080_CER": "“Cheshire, how could you?\r\nHow could you do that to her!?”",
  "LV_004045_0000_CER": "Where are you going? \r\nYou know another entrance?",
  "LV_004915_0000_NAR": "Cheshire was having a grand time\r\nsteering the lily pad every which way.",
  "SM_004020_0040_NAR": "The hairs on the back of her neck stood up.\r\nThe suspense built, until...\r\n\r\n",
  "BK_4020_0010_POO": "“Stop! With each impetuous step you sow\r\nthe seeds of ruin in our kingdom.\r\nWe will not allow you to wake \r\nthe cursed child from his slumber.”",
  "BK_8120_0010_CER": "“You know what that means:\r\nhere's the last elemental power.\r\nLet's give it a try!”",
  "SM_004070_0000_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_004070_0080_NAR": "Cereza waited for his answer\r\nwith bated breath.",
  "LV_004030_0010_CER": "There's got to be something \r\naround here I can use..",
  "SM_004070_0110_NAR": "Despite his battered body,\r\nCheshire's eyes still \r\nsmouldered with defiance.",
  "CE_004805_0000_CER": "We made it...\r\nall right back to business.",
  "SM_004010_0030_NAR": "She collapsed to her knees,\r\nher mother's final scream\r\nstill ringing in her ears.",
  "SM_004010_0120_CER": "“Why am I not surprised...\r\nI wouldn't expect a demon like you\r\nto understand anyway!”",
  "SM_004060_0020_CER": "“Thanks...\r\nYou know, to be honest,\r\nI was a little scared going alone.”",
  "LV_004040_0000_NAR": "A colossal iron structure stood before her eyes.\r\nIt was a fort, built by the faeries.",
  "LV_004055_0010_CER": "Even my witch training \r\nwasn't this tiring.",
  "LV_004910_0000_CER": "Ch-Cheshire! Not so fast!",
  "LV_004085_0000_CER": "How do you like that?\r\nDon't think I'm so shabby now, huh?",
  "BK_4080_0130_CER": "“Sorry Morgana, but I've found \r\nsomething more important.”",
  "SM_004050_0050_CER": "“Cheshire...”",
  "BK_4080_0020_NAR": "A large gash was cut on Cheshire's leg.\r\nBits of cotton were falling out,\r\nalong with his magical energy.",
  "BK_4060_0070_NAR": "With a blast, the two were sent sky high.\r\nHere's hoping that they'll be all right...",
  "CE_004815_0010_CER": "Let's get him!",
  "BK_4000_0030_CER": "“Who's there?”",
  "BK_4080_0050_NAR": "Unless the wound was mended,\r\nthe magic-infused threads that bound\r\nCheshire to this world would not last long.",
  "SM_004080_0030_CER": "“Glad to see you're up for a fight.\r\nThese naughty faeries are about \r\nto get punished!”",
  "SM_004100_0010_NAR": "Cereza let out a sigh of relief.\r\nThe wolf seemed as energetic as ever.",
  "LV_004920_0000_CER": "“Cheshire! Slow down!!”",
  "SM_004030_0010_NAR": "Cereza had certainly grown \r\nstronger since entering the forest.\r\nBut even so, making her way alone \r\nwas proving more difficult \r\nthan expected.",
  "BK_4060_0030_NAR": "The two sensed danger in the faerie \r\nnamed Púca's words, and began to run.",
  "SM_004050_0115_NAR": "When Cereza followed,\r\nshe found the wolf standing before\r\na small hole that opened into the fortress.",
  "SM_004030_0020_NAR": "If only Cheshire were here...",
  "LV_004940_0000_NAR": "An odd structure appeared out of \r\nthe gloom, towering before Cereza.",
  "SM_004050_0100_NAR": "The elusive white wolf had \r\nappeared right before Cereza.",
  "LV_004010_0000_CER": "Mummy? Is that you?",
  "BK_4080_0170_CER": "“Don't worry, it'll grow back.”\r\n",
  "SM_004080_0000_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "LV_004075_0000_CER": "Cheshire!",
  "IN_4010_0010_NAR": "Cereza and Cheshire, reunited!\r\nOnce again, the white wolf was\r\nnowhere to be found.\r\nThe intrepid pair resumed their journey.",
  "SM_004110_0070_MOR": "“My spell is almost complete.\r\nI will have you out of that forest soon.\r\nJust hold on a bit longer.”",
  "BK_4080_0220_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Well, get a move on, will you?[FONT:N ]\r\nhe added with a squeak.",
  "BK_4090_0040_NAR": "The shade vanished, \r\nwith a blood-chilling scream \r\nthat echoed through the trees.",
  "SM_004110_0080_CER": "“Oh...t-thanks Morgana.”\r\n",
  "SM_004040_0030_CER": "I'm just going to take a look.\r\nCan't let anything happen to my stuffed cat.",
  "BK_4020_0075_CER": "“So, what, are you saying\r\nyou're the faerie king or something?”",
  "SM_004010_0040_NAR": "Cheshire glanced down at Cereza.\r\nHe told her to hurry and get \r\na move on.",
  "SM_004110_0000_NAR": "Morgana's ghostly form appeared.\r\n\r\nShe took one look at Cereza\r\nand furrowed her brow.",
  "LV_004945_0000_CER": "Oops, I don't think it's supposed to turn that way...\r\nOh well, it works for me.",
  "BK_4080_0210_NAR": "But before she could finish\r\nCheshire had already returned to\r\nhis miniature form.",
  "SM_004110_0040_MOR": "“For the sake of a demon?\r\nCereza, never forget who is the \r\nmaster, and who the subject.”\r\n",
  "SM_004010_0160_CER": "“Don't forget who summoned you here!\r\nWhy don't you just behave like\r\na proper demon, and do as I say!”",
  "SM_004110_0120_CER": "“Come on, we're almost there!”",
  "SM_004010_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Come on! If I hadn't dealt with\r\nthat shade you'd be face-down \r\nat the bottom of that cliff![FONT:N ]\r\n\r\nWith each passing moment the\r\ndemon became increasingly annoyed.",
  "SM_004090_0010_CER": "“I'm not alone.\r\nI would have never made it this\r\nfar without Cheshire's help.”",
  "SM_004110_0030_NAR": "Cereza explained how she had\r\nused her hair to save Cheshire.\r\n",
  "BK_4000_0055_ROS": "“Yes, my dearest Cereza. \r\nCome, this way...”",
  "SM_004070_0150_NAR": "Thankfully, the white wolf \r\nheld the nearby faeries at bay.",
  "SM_004020_0030_NAR": "No answer.\r\n"
}
